{"id":"ed790009f55244ee","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-meetclosure.md","title":"Conjunction closure","display":"df-meetclosure — Conjunction closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-meetclosure","aliases":["27-df-meetclosure"],"display":"df-meetclosure — Conjunction closure","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-meetclosure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-meetclosure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-meetclosure — Conjunction closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\preceq b\">\\(a\\preceq b\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>; for nonempty <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}\">\\(\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\bigwedge R:\\varnothing\\ne R\\subseteq S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\bigwedge R:\\varnothing\\ne R\\subseteq S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Definition 6.5，印刷页 277，PDF 第 301 页（从 1 计数）。 此闭包只取非空子族的交，故 MeetCl_n(∅)=∅；不能暗中加入空交 all-one。布尔立方体有限，无无限交计算义务。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\preceq b","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\bigwedge R:\\varnothing\\ne R\\subseteq S\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[{"id":"12440ec6dda74879","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-meetclosure]]，$F(f)$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]。"},{"id":"2f18fe544253d997","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F(f)$ 与 $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-truefalse]]、[[27-df-meetclosure]]；$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$。下式定义 $\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)$ 的完整函数图，并声明 $\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n$ 的定义域和值域。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-meetclosure|df-meetclosure — Conjunction closure]]"},{"id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $F(f)$ and $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-truefalse]] and [[27-df-meetclosure]]."},{"id":"946d1639a1c3cf2a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-meetclosure]]."}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}